{
  "_comment": [
    "Candidate ticket-seller pages, and the result of checking them.",
    "",
    "A seller is matched to an operator by the domain the OPERATOR THEMSELVES publishes as",
    "agency_url in their BODS GTFS feed. That is the operator telling the national dataset where",
    "to find them, so no table of which subsidiary belongs to which group has to be guessed at —",
    "which is exactly the kind of guess that would send a passenger to a competitor's shop.",
    "",
    "`candidatePaths` are proposals only. `url` is set only from a check that actually ran:",
    "scripts/verify-ticket-links.mjs fetches each candidate from a CI runner (this container has",
    "no egress to operator sites), requires https, a 200, and a final hostname still on the",
    "seller's own domain, and reports the page <title> it found. Nothing is active until a run",
    "has reported it and that result has been written back here."
  ],
